  <metadata>
    <name>Long Haul 100 16.8-mile loop</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates copy the 2,133-point "Long Haul 2026" line from the organizer's CalTopo map (caltopo.com/m/558GS72), exported 2026-08-13; the map is linked as a 2027 course map from both the official race page and the 2027 UltraSignup listing. The 100-mile race runs 6 laps of this loop. Waypoints for the HQ, South Loop, and Metal Mark Pond stations are the organizer's CalTopo markers; the Day Use Area station waypoint is placed at the 0.5-mile track point per the organizer's MM 0.5 designation (no marker exists in the organizer map).</desc>
    <link href="https://caltopo.com/m/558GS72"><text>Long Haul 100 CalTopo course map</text></link>
  </metadata>
